Fish and Shark","overview":"With a strike looming, Édouard tasks Adèle with spying on her coworkers, while learning what Mark stands to gain from his marriage to Reem.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOOOiamdcZ1G2dMpRfE0GIAOgaL.jpg","released":"2026-04-10T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"45 min"},{"id":"tt35677100:1:4","season":1,"episode":4,"title":"The Mission","overview":"While Édouard and Amal scheme to prevent Mark's future ownership of the Citadel, Adèle finds herself drawn into the allure of the hotel's most elite clientele -- and starts wavering in her commitment to her oldest allies.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/23TUhry9PGllF8QCU7I0jAPchWq.jpg","released":"2026-04-17T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"41 min"},{"id":"tt35677100:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"The Fugitive","overview":"Betrayed by Edouard, Adèle embarks on a desperate escape, risking her life in the process.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4KuQ0vE15Ps5mDVxEJbpi51nGk2.jpg","released":"2026-04-24T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"42 min"},{"id":"tt35677100:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"The Citadel","overview":"On Reem and Mark’s wedding day, Adèle plans the perfect heist with the bride’s help. But nothing goes as planned.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/grd58WpeqqtL1CPwShENnRG68sU.jpg","released":"2026-05-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"44 min"}]}}